<div id="p3" class="ltx_para"><span id="p3.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">{IEEEkeywords}</span>
<p id="p3.2" class="ltx_p">Multimodal federated learning, bandwidth allocation, client scheduling, modality heterogeneity</p>
</div>
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Analysis and Optimization of Wireless Multimodal Federated Learning on Modal Heterogeneity</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
