<td id="S4.T1.4.10.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><span id="S4.T1.4.10.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Local​ unimodal​ subgradient​ of​ modality​ <math id="S4.T1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">m</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m</annotation></semantics></math>​ and​ client​ <math id="S4.T1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math></span></td></tr>
